  <h3>6.2 DeviceInfoProvider</h3>
  <p>Gets device information using root commands.</p>

  <p><strong>Data obtained:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>- Model: <code>Build.MANUFACTURER + " " + Build.MODEL</code></li>
    <li>- Android Version: <code>Build.VERSION.RELEASE</code></li>
    <li>- Build Number: <code>Build.DISPLAY</code></li>
    <li>- Architecture: <code>Build.SUPPORTED_ABIS[0]</code></li>
    <li>- Kernel Version: <code>uname -r</code> (via root)</li>
    <li>- Root Manager: Automatic detection</li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Root Manager Detection (by priority):</strong></p>
  <pre><code set:html={`1. su -v → search for "magisk", "kernelsu", "apatch"
2. /data/adb/ksu → KernelSU
3. /data/adb/ap → APatch
4. /data/adb/magisk → Magisk
5. su --version → Generic root`}></code></pre>

  <h3>6.3 RootUtils</h3>
  <pre><code set:html={`// Check root
RootUtils.tieneRoot(); // boolean

// Restart SystemUI
RootUtils.reiniciarSystemUI(() -> {
    // Callback after restart
});
// Equivalent to: killall com.android.systemui`}></code></pre>

  <h3>6.4 Root Usage in the App</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>- Restart SystemUI: <code>killall com.android.systemui</code></li>
    <li>- Force close app: <code>am force-stop {'{package}'}</code></li>
    <li>- Check root: <code>Shell.getShell().isRoot()</code></li>
    <li>- Kernel info: <code>uname -r</code></li>
  </ul>

