  <h2>10. Installation Guide</h2>

  <p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>- LG device (preferably LG V60)</li>
    <li>- Android 10+ (API 29+)</li>
    <li>- Root via Magisk, KernelSU, or APatch</li>
    <li>- LSPosed (or similar Xposed framework)</li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Step 1: Install LSPosed</strong></p>
  <pre><code set:html={`# If using Magisk:
# Download LSPosed from GitHub
# Install via Magisk Manager
# Enable in /data/adb/lspd/

# If using KernelSU:
# LSPosed usually comes preinstalled`}></code></pre>

  <p><strong>Step 2: Build or Download the Module</strong></p>
  <pre><code set:html={`# Option A: Build from source
./gradlew assembleRelease

# Option B: Download precompiled APK from releases`}></code></pre>

  <p><strong>Step 3: Install the Module</strong></p>
  <pre><code set:html={`adb install app-release.apk`}></code></pre>

  <p><strong>Step 4: Enable in LSPosed</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>- Open LSPosed</li>
    <li>- Go to Modules</li>
    <li>- Find LG Extended</li>
    <li>- Enable the module</li>
    <li>- Select scope: com.android.systemui, com.lge.launcher3, android, com.android.settings</li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Step 5: Restart</strong></p>
  <pre><code set:html={`adb shell reboot`}></code></pre>

  <p><strong>Usage:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>- Open LG Extended</li>
    <li>- Go to Hooks to configure each mod</li>
    <li>- Changes apply in real time (some require SystemUI restart)</li>
  </ul>

