  <h2>11. Troubleshooting</h2>

  <p><strong>Common problems:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>- <strong>Module doesn't appear in LSPosed</strong>: Not installed correctly → Reinstall APK and enable in LSPosed</li>
    <li>- <strong>Hooks don't work</strong>: Wrong scope → Verify all packages are selected</li>
    <li>- <strong>Battery icon doesn't change</strong>: SystemUI not restarted → Use "Restart System UI" button or reboot</li>
    <li>- <strong>DPI doesn't apply</strong>: App not in scope → Ensure the app is in LSPosed's scope</li>
    <li>- <strong>Crash when opening Settings</strong>: Hook conflict → Disable hooks temporarily</li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Where to view logs:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>- LG Extended → Logs tab</li>
    <li>- LSPosed → Logs</li>
    <li>- Logcat with filter: <code>LG_Extended</code></li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Debug commands:</strong></p>
  <pre><code set:html={`# View module logs
adb logcat | grep "LG_Extended"

# View Xposed logs
adb logcat | grep "XposedBridge"

# Force restart SystemUI
adb shell killall com.android.systemui

# View module preferences
adb shell cat /data/data/com.zxerox.lg_extended/shared_prefs/lg_extended_prefs.xml`}></code></pre>

